  m_text: 'Q: Who is this game for?

    A: For anyone who wants to improve their
    computer science skills.


    Q: What if I get stuck and don''t know how to
    solve a problem?

    A: Each room will allow players to use three hints.


    Q:
    Can I save my progress within a room to come back to later?

    A: No. Because
    the game is structured similar to a real-life escape room, players may not save
    their progress. Please make sure to allott enough time for each escape room attempt. '
